UnityFontGen/Assets/TextMesh Pro/

# ===== 本地环境 =====
config.local.*
*.log
__pycache__/

# ===== Unity 生成产物与重复大文件 =====
UnityFontGen/Assets/CN_Font.asset*
UnityFontGen/Assets/missing.txt*
UnityFontGen/Assets/Out.meta
# TMP Essentials 的目录与 .meta 均不入库
UnityFontGen/Assets/TextMesh Pro*
# 源字体与 fonts/ 重复，克隆后从 fonts/ 复制即可（见 README）
UnityFontGen/Assets/fusion.ttf*
